  <description>
    <p>
      Minimal Clock is a clean, minimalist clock, timer, and countdown app
      for the desktop.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Digital or analog clock, with an optional fill-display mode</li>
      <li>Countdown timer with a circular progress ring</li>
      <li>Named countdowns synced across devices</li>
      <li>Light and dark themes</li>
    </ul>
  </description>

